{"description":"Identifies a timeline provider, its verification key and the common HTTPS API serving all of its public and private timelines. Domain subtypes can supply company details and an inherited endpoint.","endpoint":{"description":"Base HTTPS URL of this provider’s REST API, without a trailing slash. Append /timelines/read to fetch entries and completeness for any of its timelines; append /provider for discovery and /access/create, /access/update or /access/get for Timeline Access. The SAME endpoint serves public and private timelines: public reads accept bare requests, while private reads require an authorized Ed25519 Signed Reader Request. All read responses are provider-signed. This value may be inherited from the provider type; individual timelines do not override it.","schema":{"minLength":1,"required":true},"type":"Text"},"name":"Timeline Provider","publicKey":{"schema":{"required":true},"type":"Coordination/Ed25519 Public Key"},"specification":{"blueId":"26NVkgkaq67dYNCRvZASHJvKQUQe1JM1Q3WcLK1NT5dG"}}
